summary:
  A standing position is handed over without asking whether the order lapsed.

history:
  A lid closed on a playing station and opened eight hours later: the
  stream is dead and the position stands. Every automatic road back to
  sound asks whether the order went unheard through the night first, and
  this one is such a road.

target:
  package/contents/ui/StandWatch.qml

find:
          if (seen.stoodMs <= 0 || app._orderLapsed()) return false;

replace:
          if (seen.stoodMs <= 0) return false;

expect:
  Killed by test_invariants::test_a_stream_that_stands_is_handed_to_the_road_every_other_death_takes,
  which the gate runs first, and by tst_standwatch::test_an_order_that_lapsed_is_asked_first_and_nothing_is_handed_over.
  Line-neutral.
